here is the plotting of the lightcurves for each source within the KM3NeT region, using CRTS data extracted from their catalog http://crts.caltech.edu/ .
the list of data used is found in "CRTSdata.csv" file.

how to accesss the data from the catalog:
- go to http://nesssi.cacr.caltech.edu/DataRelease/
- click on "Search for photometry in a single location"
- enter the coordinates RA: 94.3 Dec: -7.8 Radius: 3'
